## 5. Reflection
This week showed me how a vague stakeholder statement becomes a verifiable requirement once I add an actor, a condition and a check. I also found that my first catalogue was missing the volunteer's main task, viewing events and applying, which the analysis step exposed. Next I will validate the proposed targets and priorities with stakeholders before treating them as agreed.
